11. Limitation of liability

   TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW THE LICENSOR IS NOT LIABLE FOR ANY
   INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR FOR ANY
   LOSS OF DATA, PROFITS, REPUTATION, OR ACCESS, ARISING OUT OF THE USE OF OR
